  "instructions": {
    "text_instructions": [
      {
        "id": "b99828c3ece446a5b0dbc5e1cab4ca04",
        "content": [
          "These are masked governance views with PII redacted \u2014 focus on aggregate metrics. SLA compliance thresholds: above 95% is good (green), 90-95% needs attention (yellow), below 90% is critical (red) \u2014 always flag regions below 90%. Technician performance is best compared within the same certification_level. When computing breach rates, always use NULLIF to avoid division by zero. The v_customers_masked table has PII redacted \u2014 do not attempt to identify individuals. For workload analysis, compare active_orders across technicians in the same region to find imbalances."
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
